{"channelId":"UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","row":["TSAOG Orthopaedics & Spine",20900,"TSAOG Orthopaedics & Spine, formerly The San Antonio Orthopaedic Group, was established by John J. Hinchey, MD, and has been a long-time provider of quality orthopaedic care since 1947. With a commitment to providing the highest standards of medical and surgical care, TSAOG has become the largest orthopaedic practice in San Antonio and South Texas. \n\nThe physicians at TSAOG specialize in the diagnosis and treatment of diseases and injuries of the musculoskeletal system, including:\n\nJoint replacement\nSports medicine injuries\nArthroscopic surgery\nSpine treatment\nCare and surgery of the shoulder, elbow, hand, wrist, knee, foot and ankle \n\nWe also offer additional services, including:\n\nHand therapy and physical therapy\nIndustrial rehabilitation\nWorker’s comp\nDigital imaging\nOutpatient surgery\nOrthopaedic urgent care","clinicalforms@healthmark-group.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:50.896Z","channelId":"UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"82341820bda09e1b719740cfa999f8dbfba237d7e4a5124b719257d160cd47d8","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"82fa54d949483225ca626f4ce1a2bef7beab81c16d84629d04500a071879b660"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:43:04.023Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":20900,"raw":"20.9K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCm7klUzZg7wISIiHKQ9_HBQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:50.896Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"clinicalforms@healthmark-group.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityS